        {"at":"9588","op":"talkAt","dialog":"res-38#106","pilot":24,"note":"洛克｜洛克：米亚！睁开眼睛！"},
        {"at":"958C","op":"talkAt","dialog":"res-38#107","pilot":49,"note":"米亚｜米亚：啊！啊‥‥‥！我的头！"},
        {"at":"9590","op":"talkAt","dialog":"res-38#108","pilot":11,"note":"卡姆｜卡姆：米亚？怎么了？"},
        {"at":"9594","op":"talkAt","dialog":"res-38#109","pilot":24,"note":"洛克｜洛克：米亚！他们是你的敌人！"},
        {"at":"9598","op":"talkAt","dialog":"res-38#110","pilot":49,"note":"米亚｜米亚：敌人‥‥‥？你们‥‥‥是敌人！"},
        {"at":"959C","op":"talkAt","dialog":"res-38#111","pilot":11,"note":"卡姆｜卡姆：米亚！你干什么！"},
